{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-21T19:34:18.990Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-2","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"df02aa70db5bf450de2ff7ae","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-2","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"medium","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1656","claim:pm-w7clh6","lineage:pm-w7clh6","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1656+pm-w7clh6","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1656","claim:pm-w7clh6","lineage:pm-w7clh6","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-21T19:34:18.987Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Fix evidence. Cause: updateManyOptionsFromFlat normalizes the update fields through the string readers, which map null to undefined, so the null never reached resolveUpdateTransportOptions (the judge a direct runUpdateMany already uses). Fix: for a typed SDK dispatch the builder now carries each null to the normalized update record under its canonical option, so the existing judge clears a clearable field and refuses any other by name; no second rule set was written. Probe grid on the built CLI (single update beside update-many, same payload): assignee null clears in flat, nested, and nested-with-list spellings; title null and unblock_note null refuse with the identical message in both; a flat null on ids, limit, offset or any filter* key refuses with invalid_argument_value naming the key. A hazard found by the probe and designed out: the MCP provenance mark is on the action arguments, not on the merged options, so a first version cleared assignee for an MCP caller that sent assignee: null. MCP clients commonly send null for an omitted optional argument, so the builder takes an explicit typedNulls flag that only the typed SDK dispatch sets; MCP update-many keeps null as absent, unchanged from main (spec included). PmUpdateManyActionOptions now types the clearable fields as nullable (type test added, surface change acknowledged). Observed but out of scope: update-many silently ignores an unknown flat key such as bogus: 'x' where a single update refuses 'Unknown update option'; that is independent of null handling."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-21T19:34:18.990Z"}],"before_hash":"6c0b90d4eadc8e7d4f632516de94749f00fae3a051f7ed5cd23b05b77b0981dc","after_hash":"4e72c0c13c6a936ab5e2e4c61aff78f0f79ee9d55159d83a90722b7ec302c8e1","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ae3c0ee27f4189045adf91234ce968e53fcd41f804e151ef3921c058b4933785"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-21T19:51:19.111Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-2","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"df02aa70db5bf450de2ff7ae","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-2","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"medium","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1656","claim:pm-w7clh6","lineage:pm-w7clh6","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1656+pm-w7clh6","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1656","claim:pm-w7clh6","lineage:pm-w7clh6","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-21T19:51:19.111Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/contract_change","value":{"api":"runAction update-many (flat and nested update fields); PmUpdateManyActionOptions","before":"A null on an update field was dropped silently while the rest of the update applied; the option type refused null","after":"For typed SDK dispatch a null on a clearable field clears it on every matched row, any other null refuses by name before a row changes, and a null on ids, limit, offset or a filter key refuses with invalid_argument_value. PmUpdateManyActionOptions types clearable fields as nullable. MCP update-many still treats null as an omitted argument","migrate":"Remove a null you relied on being ignored, or keep it to clear the field. Omit a selection key instead of passing null"}},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/escape_class","value":"review_caught_late"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/gate_evidence","value":{"disposition":"gate_added","owner":"pm-w7clh6","gate_id":"update-many-typed-null-transport","negative_control":"tests/unit/sdk/runtime/update-many-null-transport.spec.ts runs one request through the flat, nested and nested-with-list runAction spellings and requires a cleared assignee and sprint beside an applied description; on main all three keep the assignee. It also requires the single-update refusal text for a null title and a null alias, a named refusal for a null on ids, limit, offset and a filter key, and an unchanged assignee for an MCP-marked dispatch","local_checks":["node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/sdk/runtime/update-many-null-transport.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk/runtime/runtime-input-bulk.spec.ts tests/unit/commands/lifecycle/update-many-command.spec.ts"],"hosted_checks":["Gates (coverage)","Gates (static)"]}}],"before_hash":"4e72c0c13c6a936ab5e2e4c61aff78f0f79ee9d55159d83a90722b7ec302c8e1","after_hash":"e8f08051f72b7fe3d72b29d908839ca5d8674cb5972edb35f9e4b5344334b83c","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"75ad07a295c8870816304a3916da623f9b6fa0c5c530a1c0df6ef6fbe03c8e50"}
